    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73124" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλῐγωρ-έω</span></b> , aor. I written <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠλιώρησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(8).53.5
				</span></i>
			 (Imbros, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>) : —<i>esteem
			little</i> or <i>lightly, make small account of,</i> c. gen.,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				28d
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				68c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>take no heed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				9.41
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1379b28
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>La.</u>
				180b
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς οὕτως ὠλιγωρημένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					17.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> later c. acc.,
				<i>neglect,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἄμπελον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PAvrom.</u>
					1.25
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span> : c. inf., <i>intermit,
			neglect</i> to do something, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.243
			</span></i>.</div>
